## Overview

Prayer Reminder helps you keep track of the next prayer directly from the VS Code status bar.

The extension shows the remaining time until the upcoming prayer, reminds you when it is time for Adhan, and keeps prayer times available even after restarting VS Code.

## Features

- **Open Source**: The extension is open source and available on GitHub.
- **Light**: The extension is light and doesn't affect the performance of VS Code.
- **Automatic**: Auto-detects the user location.
- **Customizable**: The extension is customizable and allows you to update the city, country, and calculation method.
